message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "3D Eclipse Simulator"
abstract: "Real-time 3D solar eclipse simulator that renders the umbra and penumbra as physical cones over a WGS84 Earth with Cesium terrain, driven by a Python/Skyfield backend using JPL DE441 ephemerides. Covers 71,264 solar eclipses from 13,000 BC to 17,000 AD."
